---
title: Permissions Rule Engine Flow
---
flowchart TD
  A[Domain Agent] --> B[Visible Eino tools\nToolSearch + InvokeDeferredTool]
  B --> C{ToolSearch?}
  C -->|select/name search| D[Registry.SearchDeferred / FindDeferredByNames]
  D --> E[Registry.MarkDiscovered\nADK session or scoped context]
  E --> F[InvokeDeferredTool\ntool_name + arguments]
  F --> G{Is deferred and discovered?}
  G -->|no| X[Error: use ToolSearch first]
  G -->|yes| H[runPreToolHooks]
  H --> I[permissions.Checker.Check\nreal target tool + args]
  I -->|allow| J[Execute target deferred tool]
  I -->|deny| K[Return permission denied]
  I -->|ask| L[einotool.Interrupt\nToolApprovalInterruptInfo]
  L --> M[Resume data approved?]
  M -->|no| N[Rejected / still waiting]
  M -->|yes| O{allow always?}
  O -->|yes| P[checker.AllowAlways\nlocal/session rule]
  O -->|no| J
  P --> J
  J --> Q[runPostToolHooks + result]
